r, like Atlas and Tigreal, because they allow him to hit more enemies with his AOE skills.","heroes":[{"id":93,"name":"Atlas","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d974ac796678180ff8724b88e192898b.png"},{"id":6,"name":"Tigreal","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8b30576754be1a4f8bebd09df8d6bec7.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Lancelot counters long-range Mages, such as Cecilion and Pharsa, because there is a delay to their skills and Lancelot can use his 1st Skill to dodge them while going in for the kill.","heroes":[{"id":91,"name":"Cecilion","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_045399c265021d47da6512e6de20b64f.png"},{"id":52,"name":"Pharsa","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_10151d43910e62f7aa9ce08df481a20f.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Lancelot is weak against heroes who can counter his mobility like Minsitthar and Phoveus, as his 1st Skill and Ultimate will be heavily restricted.","heroes":[{"id":74,"name":"Minsitthar","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c5d24a1dad6cef21de2698a4ed1d80ce.png"},{"id":106,"name":"Phoveus","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_af21c0dd8b5308c27974bff900803a9a.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilelegends.com/lore/hero/Lancelot","skins":[{"name":"Floral Knight","name_slug":"Floral-Knight","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/lancelot/Lancelot-Floral-Knight-20200729215556.webp","image_filename":"Lancelot-Floral-Knight-20200729215556.webp","released":"2020-07-29","is_original":true},{"name":"Bren Esports","name_slug":"Bren-Esports","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/lancelot/Lancelot-Bren-Esports-20211011132445.webp","image_filename":"Lancelot-Bren-Esports-20211011132445.webp","released":"2021-10-11","is_origin